      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 1r, right side (fourth section)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>naqi (=an innocent person)&rsquo;.&rdquo; And it was ordered that he should be burned. Then Matai was [brought forw]ard [to be executed]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>he said: &ldquo;How can you execute me when it is said about me &lsquo;Matai will I come and be s[een]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>before God?&rsquo;&rdquo; And they said to him: &ldquo;About you it was said &lsquo;Matai will he die, and his name perish&rsquo;.&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And it was ordered that he should be strangled.&nbsp;Then Buni was brought forward to be executed, and he said: &ldquo;How can you execute me</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>when about me it was said, &lsquo;Israel is beni, the firstborn&rsquo;?&rdquo; And they said to him: &ldquo;About you it was said, &lsquo;Behold&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I will kill binkha, the firstborn&rsquo;.&rdquo; And it was ordered that he should be stoned. Then Netzer was brought forward</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>to be executed, and he said: &ldquo;How can you execute me when it was said about me &lsquo;And a shoot shall come out from the stump of Jesse,</p>\n</li>\n<li>and a netzer will grow from its roots&rsquo;?&rdquo; And they said to him: &ldquo;About you it was said &lsquo;And you were cast out</li>\n<li>\n<p>of your tomb, like a detested netzer&rsquo;.&rdquo; And it was ordered that his neck should be cut off. Then</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Todah was brought forward to be executed, and he said to them: &ldquo;How can you execute me when about me it was said, &lsquo;(A psalm) for todah&rsquo;?&rdquo;</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And they said to him: &ldquo;However, about you it was said, &lsquo;He who sacrifices todah honors me&rsquo;.&rdquo; And it was ordered</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>that he should be executed.&nbsp;When the five disciples were executed, the governor said to Yehoshu\u02bfa</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ben Perah\u0323iah:</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
